# RouterController — SPG domain lookup and seller-managed allocation.

### lookup a seeded storefront domain
GET {{SPG_URL}}/merchant/api/v1/router/public/lookup-by-domain?domain=org1-store1.asrevo.com
Accept: application/json

### ask for TLS for a seeded storefront domain
GET {{SPG_URL}}/merchant/api/v1/router/public/ask-for-tls?domain=org1-store1.asrevo.com

### list allocated domains
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/merchant/api/v1/router/private/allocates?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: STORE-CORE-GATEWAY-JSESSIONID={{ORG_ADMIN_SESSION_ID}}
Accept: application/json

### missing store returns typed 404
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/merchant/api/v1/router/private/allocates?store=missing-store&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: STORE-CORE-GATEWAY-JSESSIONID={{ORG_ADMIN_SESSION_ID}}
Accept: application/problem+json

###
